				<ows:Abstract>Given that the number of cycles on an arc may be greater than 1, the name of the polygon files is built from a manipulation of the origin polygon files. Thus, the program looks for 'PREFIX_ORI' and 'SUFIX_ORI' in the original name and replaces them with 'PREFIX_DESTI' (and 'SUFIX_DESTI'). The destination directory is the same as the directory of the destination arcs file.</ows:Abstract>
